cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version and the Zenodo DOI."
type: software
title: "Land Cover Rewind 1985–2025"
abstract: "Software that reconstructs built-up land and four-class land cover for the epochs 1985–2025 for any area covered by the Landsat archive. A Random Forest classifier trained on a present-day 10 m land cover map labels Landsat Collection 2 composites of earlier years; an extent mask and monotonic accumulation turn per-epoch probabilities into a consistent series. Data are read anonymously from the Microsoft Planetary Computer; no account is required. Computes SDG indicator 11.3.1 from the series and a population grid of two dates. Browser app (Polish and English), command line and Python API."
version: "1.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
